.m4a", "recitedText": "وَأَصْلِحْ"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "أَصْلِحِي", "plain": "أَصْلِحِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/946f4eb785f607757c4d.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "أَصْلِحَا", "plain": "أَصْلِحَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/e9dc346bf7b756f3335e.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "أَصْلِحُوا۟", "plain": "أَصْلِحُوا", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/b368a51000ec9bf0861c.m4a", "recited": "audio/d3265fb022f34da24c6e.m4a", "recitedText": "وَأَصْلِحُوا۟"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "أَصْلِحْنَ", "plain": "أَصْلِحْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/97d365f351f4ef4f8611.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "2:160", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/167.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Except those who repent and amend and make manifest (the truth). These it is toward whom I relent. I am the Relenting, the Merciful.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ancak tevbe edip halini düzelterek gerçeği söyleyenler başka. İşte onları ben bağışlarım. Ben çok merhamet ediciyim, tevbeleri çokça kabul ederim.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "مگر وہ جو توبہ کریں اور سنواریں اور ظاہر کریں تو میں ان کی توبہ قبول فرماؤں گا اور میں ہی ہوں بڑا توبہ قبول فرمانے والا مہربان،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "kecuali mereka yang telah taubat dan mengadakan perbaikan dan menerangkan (kebenaran), maka terhadap mereka itulah Aku menerima taubatnya dan Akulah Yang Maha Menerima taubat lagi Maha Penyayang.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِلَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَابُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَصْلَحُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d800b92a13087aa4ea43.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i popravili su se", "en": "and they reformed", "tr": "ve ıslah oldular", "fr": "et ils se sont amendés", "id": "dan mereka memperbaiki diri", "ur": "اور انہوں نے اصلاح کر لی", "bn": "এবং তারা সংশোধন করল", "fa": "و اصلاح کردند"}}, {"text": "وَبَيَّنُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَتُوبُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلتَّوَّابُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "49:10", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4622.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "The believers are naught else than brothers. Therefore make peace between your brethren and observe your duty to Allah that haply ye may obtain mercy.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Müminler ancak kardeştirler. Öyleyse kardeşlerinizin arasını düzeltin ve Allah'tan korkun ki rahmete eresiniz.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "مسلمان مسلمان بھائی ہیں تو اپنے دو بھائیوں میں صلح کرو اور اللہ سے ڈرو کہ تم پر رحمت ہو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Orang-orang beriman itu sesungguhnya bersaudara. Sebab itu damaikanlah (perbaikilah hubungan) antara kedua saudaramu itu dan takutlah terhadap Allah, supaya kamu mendapat rahmat.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِنَّمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِخْوَةٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَأَصْلِحُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/83d22352da4b7c9e4cb2.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa pomirite", "en": "so make peace", "tr": "öyleyse aranızı düzeltin", "fr": "alors réconciliez-vous", "id": "maka damaikanlah", "ur": "پس صلح کراؤ", "bn": "অতএব মীমাংসা করো", "fa": "پس صلح دهید"}}, {"text": "بَيْنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَخَوَيْكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُرْحَمُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "47:5", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4550.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He will guide them and improve their state,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Allah onları doğru yola iletecek ve durumlarını düzeltecektir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "جلد انہیں راہ دے گا اور ان کا کام بنادے گا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Allah akan memberi pimpinan kepada mereka dan memperbaiki keadaan mereka,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "سَيَهْدِيهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَيُصْلِحُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/5f803a2558a81920777d.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i popravit će", "en": "and He will set right", "tr": "ve ıslah edecek", "fr": "et Il améliorera", "id": "dan Dia akan memperbaiki", "ur": "اور وہ سنوار دے گا", "bn": "এবং তিনি ঠিক করে দেবেন", "fa": "و سامان خواهد داد"}}, {"text": "بَالَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "26:152", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3084.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Who spread corruption in the earth, and reform not.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Yeryüzünde bozgunculuk yapıp dirlik düzenlik vermeyen bozguncuların emrine uymayın.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "وہ جو زمین میں فساد پھیلاتے ہیں اور بناؤ نہیں کرتے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "yang membuat kerusakan di muka bumi dan tidak mengadakan perbaikan\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُفْسِدُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُصْلِحُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/c605b921fc0ca1bdf528.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they reform", "bs": "popravljaju", "tr": "ıslah ederler", "fr": "ils réforment", "id": "mereka memperbaiki", "ur": "وہ اصلاح کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা সংশোধন করে", "fa": "اصلاح می‌کنند"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "وَأَصْلَحَ", "count": 6, "first": "5:39", "audio": "audio/813e7f36860a048f2eaa.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and he/it reformed", "bs": "i popravio je", "tr": "ve ıslah etti", "fr": "et il a réformé", "id": "dan dia telah memperbaiki", "ur": "اور اُس نے اصلاح کی", "bn": "এবং সে সংশোধন করল", "fa": "و اصلاح کرد"}}, {"arabic": "وَأَصْلَحُوا۟", "count": 4, "first": "2:160", "audio": "audio/d800b92a13087aa4ea43.m4a", "grammar": 